how to create a standalonne applicattion using maven:
======================================================
mvn archetype:generate  -DgroupId=in.<CompsnyrName> -DartifactId=<ProjectName> -
DarchetypeArtifactId=maven-archetype-quickstart -DinteractiveModel=false

mvn archetype:generate -DgroupId=in.StarAgile -DartifactId=Netflix -DarchetypeGroupId=org.apache.maven.archetypes -DarchetypeArtifactId=maven-archetype-quickstart -DarchetypeVersion=1.4 -DinteractiveMode=false


by executing  the above code, we r going to create a intial project folder structure

------------------------------------------
maven goals/maven lifecycle 
------------------------------------------
clean-            it will delete the target folder                   mvn clean
test              it will test the source code                       mvn test
compile           it will compile the source code                    mvn compile
package           it will package the project code                   mvn package

note - all maven starts with mvn
       mvn clean packages
       all maven goals should be executed in the path where pom.xml file available
       all artifacts, we can store in nexus/jfrog/s3 buckets


the war which got genertaed will deployed into the server
